.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-pages-scaffold - Generate starter custom HTML from a page's current render


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad pages scaffold  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate starter custom HTML for a page that doesn't have any yet, using a static snapshot of how the page renders today.

.PP
The snapshot is a one-time export, not a faithful copy: pushing it converts the page to custom HTML, which replaces the dynamic storefront/editor experience — a rich-text page stops being editable in the in-app editor, and a default profile page stops updating automatically as your store changes.

.PP
For a page that already has custom HTML, use \fBgumroad pages pull\fR instead — that's the real pull → edit → push round trip.

.PP
Use the slug "profile" to scaffold from your profile landing page's default storefront render.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Overwrite the output file if it already exists

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for scaffold

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	Write the HTML to this path (- for stdout; defaults to \&.html)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad pages scaffold about
  gumroad pages scaffold about -o starter.html
  gumroad pages scaffold profile
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-pages(1)\fP
